  "limitations": [
    "Current 18-scene Golemancy client uses explicit predecessor research, 32+32 theories, physical component/source fixtures, seal items/filters, provider contents and later Direct/Logistics stages. It actually completes Mind, forms the press, pays C2S components and 12 Machina, extracts and deploys the manufactured golem, configures physical seals through their menus, collects and stores three dropped diamonds, requests and receives two apples through provider task AI, switches following and picks up the exact owned props item. No output golem is supplied.",
    "The advanced seal and six-material gallery scenes include deliberate state/display fixtures. Current screenshots and tests establish the audited operational mechanics; they do not establish natural acquisition of every gallery design or a full manual survival campaign.",
    "74 canonical research keys are supported: the preserved 51-key baseline plus the audited 23 Golemancy keys. MATSTUDVOID, GOLEMFLYER, ESSENTIATRANSPORT and other late/world research remain unavailable; full Golemancy and full TC6 are not complete.",
    "Infusion has 56 registered recipes, 15 with implemented research paths and 41 preserving late research gates. The four new paths are Biothaumic Mind and Harvest/Butcher/Break seals. Advanced/Greater Firebat/Pech/Primordial Pearl world acquisition remains incomplete; available research and fixture crafting do not establish every natural world prerequisite.",
    "All 21 original focus types and the prior production/Thaumatorium/Hedge/Clockwork/Infusion features are preserved and included in the integrated server suite. Their separate current client evidence is historical unless listed in clientProfiles; historical 0.22 GolemPress/EssentiaProduction and 0.19 Auromancy records are retained explicitly.",
    "Original BETA26 quirks remain, including props0 press animation, the final blocked-output zero-cost stall, rank attribute update timing and released focus cooldown/key behavior. Modern navigation, rendering, native particles, loaded-only boundaries, transaction guards, protection hooks and ore dictionary-to-tag matching are documented adaptations.",
    "The original ungated natural Zombie/Brainy brain drop branches and server scan/progression hooks are connected. Brainy visual catalogue entities and the remaining TC6 world ecology are separate from a claim of completed natural world generation.",
    "No independent-client multiplayer or complete manual survival campaign is established by these checks."
  ],
